# All sports locked except the one unlocked

**Before any site work:** lock every sport and every results card. Unlock only
the sport the owner named.

Requires **UNLOCK &lt;SPORT&gt;** plus the miss. One sport. One miss.

A hang, timeout, cloaking fix, checker, or chrome pass is not an unlock for
any other sport. Do not touch `NHL77FINAL.py` / `team_results_charts.py` /
`mlb_*` for sport B while sport A is the unlock.

```
# BAD — owner unlocked nothing; agent edits NHL77FINAL.py for soccer while MLB is locked
# BAD — owner said UNLOCK MLB Books; agent also patches CFL/soccer
# GOOD — UNLOCK MLB + Books/H2H on that card; leave every other sport alone
```

